WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.965
Hi! I'm Bia. Meet my friends! What sports do they practice?

2
00:00:06.415 --> 00:00:08.877
This is Lucas. He's ten years old.

3
00:00:09.327 --> 00:00:12.392
He plays soccer in the park with his friends after school.

4
00:00:14.642 --> 00:00:17.382
This is Julia. She does yoga every morning.

5
00:00:17.832 --> 00:00:19.364
She loves the mountains!

6
00:00:21.614 --> 00:00:25.190
Hi! I'm Pedro. I go cycling with my friends on Saturdays.

7
00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:28.334
Pedro, do you go cycling on Sundays too?

8
00:00:28.784 --> 00:00:30.873
No, I don't. On Sundays, I sleep!

9
00:00:33.123 --> 00:00:35.863
This is Carla. She does karate.

10
00:00:36.313 --> 00:00:40.307
She practices on Tuesdays and Thursdays, at a club near her house.

11
00:00:42.557 --> 00:00:47.387
Hi! I'm Rafa. I live in Florianópolis, and I go surfing on the weekend.

12
00:00:47.837 --> 00:00:49.137
I love the ocean!

13
00:00:51.387 --> 00:00:53.105
And these are my friends from work.

14
00:00:53.555 --> 00:00:57.782
They play volleyball on the beach on Sundays. And I play with them!

15
00:01:00.032 --> 00:01:03.654
And you? Do you practice any sports or activities?

